WEBVTT

00:22:58.957 --> 00:23:02.377
and so many women across Uganda,

00:23:02.377 --> 00:23:05.213
across Africa and across the world.

00:23:05.880 --> 00:23:10.051
MR: I wonder what kind
of message you would give

00:23:10.093 --> 00:23:13.304
you know, just at the end
of this conversation,

00:23:13.304 --> 00:23:16.391
a final message of what action
everybody can take.

00:23:17.308 --> 00:23:19.102
And now I'm not talking about Africa.

00:23:19.102 --> 00:23:21.104
I'm actually talking more about the world

00:23:21.146 --> 00:23:24.941
that needs to move more quickly

00:23:24.983 --> 00:23:26.651
out of fossil fuel, for example.

00:23:26.693 --> 00:23:29.529
But what message would you have

00:23:29.529 --> 00:23:32.991
for those who are listening
to this conversation?